NAME
       shutdown, reboot - stop the machine

SYNOPSIS
       int cervus_shutdown(void);
       int cervus_reboot(void);

DESCRIPTION
       Flushes every filesystem and then powers off through ACPI, or
       restarts. Both require root or a successful sudo check.

RETURN VALUE
       Does not return on success; negative on failure.

ERRORS
       EPERM   the caller is not permitted to do this

SEE ALSO
       shutdown(1), reboot(1), sync(2), auth(2)
